---
// Entrepreneurship: the path with its branches, and what each one came to. Verdicts are the real status, nothing rounded up.
import '../styles/chapter.css';
---
<section class="ch ent" id="entrepreneurship" aria-labelledby="en-t">
  <div class="open">
    <p class="meta kick">Entrepreneurship</p>
    <h2 id="en-t">Ideas tested. <em>Some shipped.</em></h2>
    <svg class="sig" data-sig="ent" viewBox="0 0 320 200" aria-hidden="true"></svg>
    <p class="ch-lede">A consultancy co-founded, a freelance year, and three ideas now being tested with AI.</p>
  </div>

  <ol class="path">
    <li>
      <p class="when">2016 – 2019</p>
      <div><h3>Business consulting at HOP</h3><p>Before BI. A few highly technical spreadsheets were the first step towards working with data.</p></div>
      <p class="verdict"><span class="meta">The start</span></p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <p class="when">2019 – 2021</p>
      <div><h3>Co-founder, WeValue – Consulting</h3><p>Management and client advisory, responsible for public contracts. 9 of the 10 projects I submitted were approved.</p></div>
      <p class="verdict"><span class="meta">Shipped</span></p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <p class="when">2021</p>
      <div><h3>Freelance BI consultant</h3><p>Power BI reports that delivered management gains for clients, a SQL database and several SSIS processes.</p></div>
      <p class="verdict"><span class="meta">Shipped</span></p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <p class="when">2026</p>
      <div><h3>AI Trading Bot</h3><p>Three bots on paper since October. Review on 11 December; no real money until then. <a class="ul" href="/work/ai-trading-bot/">The case study</a></p></div>
      <p class="verdict"><span class="meta live">Piloting</span></p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <p class="when">2026</p>
      <div><h3>Personal CFO</h3><p>A commercial version was assessed and set aside: bank access in Switzerland is contractual, the Wallet API forbids commercial use, and the economics are tight.</p></div>
      <p class="verdict"><span class="meta">Set aside</span></p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <p class="when">2026</p>
      <div><h3>Property Deal Radar</h3><p>Built for my own investments first. The kind of tool an estate agent would want; it may become a product.</p></div>
      <p class="verdict"><span class="meta">Alpha</span></p>
    </li>
  </ol>
  <div class="close"><p>Most branches end in an open circle. That is the point of testing them: the one that reaches the surface earns it.</p></div>
</section>

<style>
  .path{margin-top:clamp(48px,8vh,88px);border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
  .path li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);gap:8px 48px;padding:24px 0 26px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line2)}
  @media (min-width:980px){.path li{grid-template-columns:minmax(180px,2.2fr) minmax(0,6fr) minmax(0,3.8fr);align-items:baseline}}
  .path .when{font:450 13px/1.5 var(--mono);letter-spacing:.04em;color:var(--t3)}
  .path h3{font-size:clamp(20px,1.7vw,25px);line-height:1.2;font-weight:620;letter-spacing:-.01em}
  .path li > div > p{margin-top:6px;font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--t2);max-width:56ch}
  .path .verdict .meta{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;color:var(--t2)}
  .path .verdict .meta::before{content:"";width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1.5px var(--t3)}
  .path .verdict .meta.live::before{background:var(--signal);box-shadow:none}
</style>
